.TH "nvme_init_identify_exported_nvm_subsys_template_uuid_list" 9 "nvme_init_identify_exported_nvm_subsys_template_uuid_list" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_identify_exported_nvm_subsys_template_uuid_list \- Initialize passthru command for Exported NVM Subsystem Template UUID List
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_identify_exported_nvm_subsys_template_uuid_list
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "struct nvme_exported_nvm_subsys_template_uuid_list *list "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Command data structure to initialize
.IP "list" 12
User space destination address to transfer the data
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Identify command with
CNS value NVME_IDENTIFY_CNS_EXPORTED_NVM_SUBSYS_TEMPLATE_UUID_LIST.
